        {
          "text": " “Ido kiwadikak emalaika loka ekanisa lokotoma Sarudio ebe: Inera kwanata ŋol loejaas Imoyon ikanykaarei luka Edeke, ka aacer akanykaarei ebe:",
          "type": "text",
