        },
        {
          "text": " Ŋin yenipikori itanapio kwaŋin inapen lukakwaŋak, kwabo mam cut amwatari ekekiror koitabo loka aijar; eoŋ da alimori ekekiror kakonyen nuka Papaka, kakonyen da nuka imalaikanake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
