        {
          "text": " “Ido kiwadikak emalaika loka ekanisa lokotoma Piladelupia ebe: Inera kwanata Lokalaunan, lokabeit, loejaas kelacet loka Daudi, loeŋaari kwabo emamei yenegoli, loegoli da kwabo emamei yeneŋaari, ebe:",
